<title>POLAND: BWR TURNS TO LOSS IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>BWR TURNS TO LOSS IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net loss					 0.10 vs    0.32 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss				   0.31 vs    0.36 profit</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations	     2.25 vs    2.90</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues    8.25 vs    6.97</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.45 vs    2.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.63 vs    2.33</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 12.88 vs   11.44</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	35.03 vs   26.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
